Fri Nov  6 20:30:00 UTC 2026 - Neal Haas <neal.haas@gmail.com>

- Initial package, version 0.1.0
  * Cockpit page and selinux-fixer CLI that read SELinux denials
    from the audit log and journal, explain them and fix them on
    request (restorecon, file context rules, port labels,
    booleans, relabel, local policy module as a last resort)
  * Undo for booleans, modules, port labels and file context rules
  * Support for Tumbleweed, Leap 16 and transactional systems
    (Kalpa, Aeon, MicroOS)
  * Bugzilla report links for the running distribution
